The zukzeit package contains original work and modified derivatives of three
time-series foundation models: TimesFM, Toto 2.0, and Chronos-2. Each
derivative is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose complete
text is distributed in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

