Modified TimesFM derivative
----------------------------

The following files contain a translation and modification of the official
TimesFM Python/PyTorch implementation into native R/torch:

  R/arch-timesfm.R
  R/timesfm-feasibility.R
  R/timesfm-inference.R
  R/timesfm-module.R
  R/timesfm-state.R

Original work: TimesFM
Copyright 2025 Google LLC
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Source: https://github.com/google-research/timesfm
Pinned source revision: 3dae50b20d7a724981e8ea36cda75578f80dd2dc

The files above were translated from Python/PyTorch to R/torch and modified for
R tensor conventions, checkpoint loading, engine contracts, device handling,
batching, and package integration. They carry prominent modification notices.
The pinned upstream source contains no NOTICE file.

Modified Toto 2.0 derivative
----------------------------

The following files contain a translation and modification of the official
Toto 2.0 Python/PyTorch implementation into native R/torch:

  R/arch-toto.R
  R/toto-inference.R
  R/toto-module.R
  R/toto-state.R

Original work: Toto 2.0
Copyright 2026 Datadog, Inc.
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Source: https://github.com/DataDog/toto
Pinned source revision: 46bd92adeeef6b3c2afb21008659f607fa203e38

The files above were translated from Python/PyTorch to R/torch and modified for
R tensor conventions, checkpoint loading, engine contracts, device handling,
batching, and package integration, including the unit-scaling primitives, the
causal patch scaler, the xPos rotary path, and the variate-axis attention
arrangement. They carry prominent modification notices. The pinned upstream
source contains no NOTICE file.

