Numerical reference fixtures
----------------------------

The reference files under the following directories were generated from the
corresponding pinned official implementation and checkpoint:

  tests/testthat/fixtures/timesfm/
  tests/testthat/fixtures/toto/
  tests/testthat/fixtures/chronos2/

They are distributed as upstream-derived test material under the same
Apache-2.0 terms as the implementation each was generated from. The fixture
generators, input definitions, and R test harness are original zukzeit work.

Checkpoint weights
------------------

Checkpoint weights are not included in this package. When explicitly requested
by a user they are downloaded from their upstream repository and remain subject
to the licence reported by zuk_models(), currently Apache-2.0 for every
supported checkpoint.
